PEAA Reforged is distributed under the Minecraft Mod Public License (MMPL).

Why: this mod reuses textures and display strings from "ProjectE Advanced Alchemy"
(PEAA) by Ryokusitai, which is distributed under MMPL_J 1.0.1 -- the Japanese
translation of MMPL -- as stated on its distribution page:
https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projecte-advanced-alchemy/license

MMPL_J states that it is a translation of MMPL Version 1.0.1 and that where the
translation and the original disagree, the original MMPL governs. The canonical
English text of MMPL 1.0.1 therefore follows in full, retrieved from
https://mod-buildcraft.com/MMPL-1.0.txt

Per section 6, the complete source for this mod is available at no cost:
  https://github.com/nokopi36/PEAA-Reforged

The mod's own code was written from scratch for Minecraft 1.21.1 and copies no
code from PEAA. See CREDITS.md and docs/ASSETS.md for what is reused and where
it came from.

